2508       options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
2508     ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
2509       %let syscc=0;
2510       title; footnote;
2511       ods _all_ close;
2512       ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
2513       ods graphics off;
2514       proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.A (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
