NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASMAC1 (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: File WORK.SASMAC1 (memtype=CATALOG) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
